ack operational details (e.g., how to derive co-expression modules, how to tune shrinkage).\\\",\\n        \\\"issues\\\": [\\n          \\\"No specific method for deriving co-expression modules from provided data.\\\",\\n          \\\"Shrinkage parameter tuning is mentioned but not operationalized (e.g., cross-validation over perturbations).\\\",\\n          \\\"No plan for handling perturbations with very few cells beyond shrinkage.\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"improvements\\\": [\\n          \\\"Specify co-expression module derivation: e.g., use PCA or hierarchical clustering on control cells, select modules with >10 genes.\\\",\\n          \\\"Operationalize shrinkage: blend predicted effect with control mean using weight w tuned by cross-validation over perturbations (e.g., grid search w in [0,1]).\\\",\\n          \\\"For perturbations with <20 cells, consider excluding from training or using strong shrinkage (w > 0.9).\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"validation\\\": \\\"Validate mitigation strategies via cross-validation: compare performance with and without shrinkage, with and without module-based features.\\\",\\n        \\\"biological_validation\\\": \\\"Check that shrinkage does not eliminate known strong effects (e.g., ribosomal gene knockdown).\\\",\\n        \\\"decision_support_mitigation\\\": \\\"No decision support provided; recommend evaluating mitigation strategies in pilot experiments to inform model selection.\\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"questions\\\": {\\n      \\\"formulation\\\": {\\n        \\\"assessment\\\": \\\"The analysis does not explicitly formulate research questions or hypotheses, which is a gap. The problem definition implies questions but they are not\",\n  \"parse_error\": \"Failed to parse JSON response\"\n}\n\nRequirements:\n1. Keep the same high-level structure when possible.\n2. Resolve issues called out in the comments.\n3. Add explicit assumptions where information is missing.\n4. Return only valid JSON (no markdown).